  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Qiao Zhi Cai identifies the plant as the great profound ice light radish, an extinct immortal plant from the Immemorial Antiquity Era that Heavenly Court still kept. Wu Yong confirms the name and warns that if anyone gets close, the radish bursts out with countless ice lights that pierce muscle and skin and freeze the victim to death.",
      "chapters": [
        1709
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "extinct-immortal-plant",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_qiao_zhi_cai",
        "evt_era_immemorial",
        "fac_heavenly_court",
        "char_wu_yong"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Those ice lights are the dao marks of the great profound ice light radish. After it shoots them out, the radish no longer has any dao marks and becomes a mortal material. The ice light storm has the power of a rank eight Gu Immortal’s immortal killer move.",
      "chapters": [
        1709
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "ice-light-dao-marks",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When a Southern Border Gu Immortal is teleported beside the radish, it shrinks to one-third of its size and fires countless ice needles; the victim is pierced and frozen into an ice statue despite strongest defenses. The spaceless formation’s teleport variation and the radish are called a perfect combination.",
      "chapters": [
        1709
      ],
